<%@ include file="header.jspf" %>
<h1>Version History</h1><p><c:out value="${file.name}"/></p><section><h2>Upload New Version</h2><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/version/upload"><%@ include file="csrf.jspf" %><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${file.id}"><label for="file">PDF, TXT, PNG or JPEG, up to 10 MiB</label><input id="file" type="file" name="file" accept=".pdf,.txt,.png,.jpg,.jpeg" required><button>Upload New Version</button></form><p>A new version has its own key and IV. Grant counts do not reset. Pinned grants stay pinned; latest-version grants resolve the newest active version. Existing viewers remain pinned to their original version.</p></section><section class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Version</th><th>Name</th><th>Size / UTC time</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach var="v" items="${rows}"><tr><td><c:out value="${v.number}"/> <c:if test="${v.current}">(current)</c:if></td><td><c:out value="${v.name}"/></td><td><c:out value="${v.size}"/> bytes<br><c:out value="${v.createdAt}"/></td><td><c:out value="${v.status}"/></td><td><c:if test="${v.status eq 'ACTIVE'}"><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/version/archive" data-confirm="Archive this version? Existing viewers will lose access."><%@ include file="csrf.jspf" %><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${file.id}"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="${v.id}"><button>Archive Version</button></form></c:if></td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table></section>
<c:set var="hasNext" value="${rows.size() eq 20}"/><%@ include file="pagination.jspf" %>
<%@ include file="footer.jspf" %>
